v0.088: DPD customs - send DAP incoterms and Company EORI/VAT as importer details

- invoice.termsOfDelivery now sent as DAP on every Irish/customs DPD shipment,
  confirmed against DPD's own live API schema (browsed developers.api.dpd.co.uk,
  not guessable from generic Incoterms docs).
- Company gains EORI/VAT number fields (Companies page), sent as
  invoice.importerDetails.eoriNumber/vatNumber for orders linked to that
  company - BNS is the exporter, the linked company is the importer of
  record, confirmed against a real DPD commercial invoice example.
- Booking a customs shipment for an order linked to a company with no EORI
  set now stops with a clear message instead of DPD silently missing it.
- Updated the project's dpd-api-findings.md with the confirmed schema.

